OL,3,ACouple were celebrating anniversary
OL,4,Abefore Bahamas tragedy
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to the BBC on Sunday, Nathan,
OL,7,Fwho is now back home with their sons,
OL,8,Fsaid the trip had been an early
OL,9,Fcelebration for their anniversary in
OL,10,FDecember.
